15651581,2025-09-01,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Getting a credit card,Problem getting a working replacement card,"Complainant : XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX Respondent : 1st Progress Card Services ( A Division of Synovus Bank ) Subject : Failure to Issue Secured Credit Card and Provide Required Disclosures To the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau, I am submitting this complaint against 1st Progress Card Services regarding their failure to provide the secured credit card and required disclosures in a timely and lawful manner. 



