15898493,2025-09-12,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,"Other features, terms, or problems",Problem with rewards from credit card,"Inconsistent with the terms of Chases XXXX Rewards Program Agreement ( the Agreement '' ), Chase will not pay me the 5 % cash back that I am due on XXXX purchases during a period of my XXXX XXXX XXXX  ( instead of the 3 % paid to XXXX XXXX ), even after I brought the error to their attention. 

