16025431,2025-09-18,Vehicle loan or lease,Loan,Managing the loan or lease,Billing problem,"Subject : Bridgecrest False/Misleading Response to Prior Complaint ( Case # XXXX ) I am submitting a new complaint because Bridgecrest provided false and misleading responses to the CFPB and failed to provide the documents I specifically requested. 

