16184309,2025-09-25,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"The following companies have violated my rights to privacy as well as furnished unauthorized and unverified debts on my consumer reports without my express written consent. I've also recognized other Violations listed below reported by TransUnion, Experian & Equifax thus damaging my commercial reputation in violation of F.D.C.P.A and F. C.R.A. 

