16250794,2025-09-29,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"This complaint is filed to demand immediate regulatory enforcement against the abovenamed Respondents for systemic, willful, and repeated violations of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ), and the Truth in Lending Act ( TILA ). 

