Unauthorized Hard Inquiries Multiple inquiries from XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX, XXXX XXXX, XXXX, and others were made without my consent. 

These inquiries are the result of identity theft. 

Secondary Bureaus Suppressions and Freezes XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX have placed unauthorized freezes, fraud alerts, and suppressions on my consumer files. 

These actions materially interfere with my rights under FCRA to access, dispute, and correct my consumer information. 

Illegal Deletion of Positive PaidOff Auto Loans XXXX XXXX XXXX ( Account No. XXXX ) : This was a legitimate, paidoff auto loan with a balance of {$43000.00}. It was deleted from my credit reports without cause. 

XXXX XXXX XXXX ( Account XXXX. XXXX ) : This was another legitimate, paidoff auto loan with a balance of {$17000.00}. It too was illegally deleted from my credit reports. 

These deletions are unlawful under FCRA XXXX ( b ) and XXXX ( a ), as they removed accurate, favorable credit history that I rightfully earned. 

